OL,3,AClose race as Iceland votes on whether
OL,4,Ato restart talks on joining EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FIcelanders are voting in a referendum
OL,7,Fto decide whether to resume talks on
OL,8,Fjoining the European Union, 13 years
OL,9,Fafter they were broken off.
OL,11,FIn an indication of how tight the
OL,12,Fresult is expected to be, the latest
OL,13,Fopinion poll put the No campaign in the
OL,14,Flead with 51.6%. An earlier poll had
OL,15,Fput the Yes campaign ahead.
OL,17,FPrime Minister Kristrun Frostadottir's
OL,18,Fcentre-left government had already
OL,19,Fintended to hold a referendum, but
OL,20,Fturbulent international affairs
OL,21,Fprompted her to bring it forward.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
