OL,3,AClose race as Iceland votes on whether
OL,4,Ato restart talks on joining EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the debate was fought less over
OL,7,FNato member Iceland's security concerns
OL,8,Fthan over its vital fishing industry
OL,9,Fand sovereignty.
